THE VOIDMODS LOGO

The "V" logo is the official icon of ModConfigs (the MOD CONFIGS menu row and
hub) and of every official VOIDMOD made by Voidmaster01. It is found in:
  - branding/voidmod.png
  - branding/voidmod.ico
  - "Void Mods Icon.png"
and is embedded into the compiled mod files, where ModConfigs and the official
VOIDMODS show it.

Copyright (c) 2026 Voidmaster01. All rights reserved. The logo is NOT covered by
the MIT License above. It may be copied and shared, unchanged, as part of
ModConfigs and the official VOIDMODS (including unmodified copies of their
releases). It may not be edited, and it may not be used to mark, brand or
advertise any other mod, project or product, including forks of this repository
that are not official VOIDMODS. Other mods that add pages to MOD CONFIGS through
ConfigHub keep the "voidMod" flag (which shows the logo next to a mod) set to
false.

